   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Folkehelse** se refiere a la salud de la población. **Levekår** son las condiciones de vida; **tilgang til** indica que algo está al alcance de una persona.",
     "@en": "**Folkehelse** refers to the health of the population. **Levekår** are living conditions; **tilgang til** indicates that something is within reach of a person."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Ikke bare ... men også ...** presenta dos factores importantes, sin reducir el tema a uno solo.",
     "@en": "**Ikke bare ... men også ...** has two important factors, without reducing the subject to one."
    }
   ]
  },
